  items:
  - Name: Shepard Essence
    Description: If a piece of land is not used for extraction, it is usually purchased
      by farmers or shepherds. The latter are typically introverted people with little
      interest in social life. They simply prefer to stay with their animals.
    ShortDescription: Essence of a Life grown within a shepard.
    GamePlayDescription: 
