      chance: 30
  - Name: Mechanical Essence
    Description: The mechanics of these lands repair the machines used to extract
      clay, which wear down very easily.
    ShortDescription: Essence of a Life grown within a mechanic.
    GamePlayDescription: 
    SmallIcon: {fileID: 0}
